mbos  that I like best place for food in the  world Greek cuisine I love the family  style essence of it I love how it's like  one pot cooking the vegetables that  they've grown in their garden and any  animal that they use on them on the menu  they've either grown or they've either  sorted out themselves I love the idea of  a very simple salad with a very simple  stefada or musaka or something like that  I really love that it's the grannies in  the kitchen cooking and you can taste  all of the love and the heaven coming  down into that meal if this girl was not  successful Academy award-nominated  actress I am quite confident that she  would be a food writer because the way  that she romanticizes food is sexy as  [ __ ] and I also have to agree on the  Greek food like Greek food is inherently  delicious and very well balanced it's a  great example of the Mediterranean diet  which we actually have ample evidence to  support for lowering the risk of chronic  diseases like metabolic syndrome heart  disease diabetes and inflammation so  let's call this diet recall like it is  probably one of the most supportive  examples of celebrities diet the Harvest  Bazaar has ever published I think that  Publications like Harper's Bazaar do  have a responsibility to viewers to like  screen these interviews and determine if  they're problematic or super restrictive  and at the very least like issue a  trigger warning or disclaimer so I'm  always so jazzed to see a celebrity with  a non-diet supportive relationship with  food on this platform and on that note  that's all that I have for you guys  today if you like this video be sure to  give it the thumbs up leave me a comment  below on who or what if you'd like to  see me review next subscribe to the  channel and I'll see you next time on  Abby's kitchen bye foreign  [Music]
 

